    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T09:03:30Z",
    "body": "For external files we'll be running these steps from a queued task so the distinction doesn't make much sense. You could maybe observe it by setting a timer from the loaded scripts in a user agent that prioritizes timers over load events.\n\nAs I commented in #1816 I think we should not queue an additional task here.\n",
