    "created_at": "2016-09-27T14:31:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-27T14:31:49Z",
    "body": "I am unable to find any way of making the load event fire \"synchronously\", i.e. it seems like \"execute a script block\" always executes from inside a task, no matter what weird contortions I do. (My idea from https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1816#discussion_r80462070 of creating the script outside the document and that causing the download to finish doesn't seem to work, among many others I tried.)\n\nSo I conclude that indeed I should remove the extra task-posting for module scripts. I will send a PR to do so, although I'd like to make that as a separate change from #1816, so please someone review/merge that first :).\n",
